<description>&lt;p&gt;Thailand is tightening border security as police chiefs order stricter controls and the air force scrambles F-16s to intercept unidentified aircraft near the Tak border, while Thailand and Myanmar have agreed to joint water-quality monitoring of border rivers and six monitoring stations to address arsenic from Shan State mines. CP All will close all 7-Eleven stores in Cambodia and Thais have donated 269 million baht for a Thai-Cambodian border fence and shelters. A Chanthaburi man confessed to an acid attack on his wife and a father and son were jailed for smuggling about £500,000 of cannabis. The UCDP recorded 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxNcUpsRzU0UGYxVkZCSEoxZEswM1VjdHJqYWRtNFlIdHBUSy1XWVdXeXV6d3hFYktIR3Z0VGtPeW5YSkYwZDhoallmLUVnbjVBeW5jSnZwb2plU2tEQjNSX1hBbGxoc0FtVVotRVlubDR0YVNRTzUyMGRqWEFsMWNJT0RYXzRwNWxyWXpvdnVHeWpZU05oZWJfc0pUZEE2cU0?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nikkei Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxPMko5YVd6SkdqLUdkZWFTTEk1ak5Od28tUWtKNDhrVTdiVnBlSHhRaEJVenhkMTZpQVZWN0J5LWNHYkpWU044VlduWkhFcUE2TTI4ZVF3ZzluU2FsX2RyQ3p0STFSZ2xUSG1BZFBONTl0WnRJdFcxV3BkOERUUmpiOVRpLVBNWUlMOUJNeFo5X0ZoM1UwVU16OHRmOXI4cEkzS21yWnhsZ3otdDVjaUtSTDh2d3VzVXlWQTc4RGs2bldjRmE5QkR4b0dpMko1Zw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Pattaya Mail&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxNRGhKUnB2UmJOUUdHYXoxM1NraWhoVnVYNVJ4M1o1bks5YjNpNk5kMlhRNWlmWlJ0dGhDa3FfbVNfRktvU3pjX1FDS3IwN2R4a3VBXy1SWHl2ZXQ2TE55T3g1eThQbnFIVU4wMzIxQ2piSng3eHlqUkZCNTBrc0poMTZjTEg4azlPczV2aS1nY3hVWUlPclZ3am9Pc2F1cC0yNDBEZmhuT3p0SVVIcHltQTA1VjczbUx0cnhnOEhXcDI2Q2NTLTZOR2Jn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Pattaya Mail&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nature World News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news